<title>UK: RALLYING-RAC RALLY SECOND DAY LEADERS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-RAC RALLY SECOND DAY LEADERS.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTER, England 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading overall</p>
<p>positions after the second leg of the RAC Rally on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Armin Schwarz (Germany) Toyota overall time of 2 hours</p>
<p>53 minutes and 52 seconds</p>
<p>2. Masao Kamioka (Japan) Subaru five minutes 11 seconds</p>
<p>behind</p>
<p>3. Stig Blomqvist (Sweden) Skoda	  12.43</p>
<p>4. Pavel Sibera (Czech Republic) Skoda  17.28</p>
<p>5. Krzysztof Holowczyc (Poland) Ford    17.36</p>
<p>6. Gregoire de Mevius (Belgium) Renault 19.37</p>
</text>
